<title>POLAND: President appoints aide Belka new Polish finmin.</title>
<headline>President appoints aide Belka new Polish finmin.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish President Aleksander Kwasniewski at a ceremony on Tuesday appointed his economic adviser Marek Belka as new finance minister after accepting the resignation of Grzegorz Kolodko.</p>
</text>
